      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Trouver le quartier le plus proche",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}?action=findquartier&lat=47.2173&lng=-1.5536&maxDistance=50",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "action",
                  "value": "findquartier"
                },
                {
                  "key": "lat",
                  "value": "47.2173",
                  "description": "Latitude"
                },
                {
                  "key": "lng",
                  "value": "-1.5536",
                  "description": "Longitude"
                },
                {
                  "key": "maxDistance",
                  "value": "50",
                  "description": "Distance maximale en km (optionnel)",
                  "disabled": false
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Trouve le quartier le plus proche d'un point GPS avec résolution intelligente:\n\n1. **Point-in-polygon** (priorité haute)\n2. **Point-in-multiple-polygons** (sélection du plus petit)\n3. **Nearest-centroid-within-threshold** (< 200m)\n4. **Fallback to secteur** (centroid du secteur parent)\n\n**Réponse:**\n```json\n{\n  \"quartierId\": \"Q001\",\n  \"quartierNom\": \"Centre-Ville\",\n  \"distance\": 1.234,\n  \"resolutionMethod\": \"point-in-polygon\",\n  \"resolutionDetails\": \"Point dans 1 polygone\"\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        },
